<title>POLAND: INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 161 MLN POLISH T-BONDS.</title>
<headline>INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 161 MLN POLISH T-BONDS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investos bid for 134 million zlotys of Poland's 15-percent two-year Treasury bonds and for 27 million zlotys of 12-percent five-year bonds on Wednesday against a one billion offer, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Full details of the auction should be available later in the day. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
